 "description": "Files shows every file on the badge as it is: the SD card, USB drives\nand the badge's own storage. Enter opens a folder, or a file with the app\nthat opens it (Write for notes, the Picture viewer for photos); the\nsquare key's options open a file with another app, rename, copy, cut,\npaste, make a folder and delete. The triangle goes to your home folder,\nthe cross to Drives, where Enter mounts a drive when it needs to.\n\nIt opens from the Files tile on the home screen.",
